fact WorkItem(id: "WI-147", description: some(value: "smt-gen: emit anthill_abs define-fun for SMT-LIB scripts that mention abs(). SMT-LIB has no built-in abs for Real; cited-rule lifts and direct discharges that touch abs (e.g. |d_next - d_prev| in lf1 step_distance_lemma) currently emit raw (abs ...) which Z3 treats as an uninterpreted Function. Surface area: in anthill-smt-gen process_body_goal, detect abs-functor calls (qualified name anthill.prelude.Numeric.abs or short-form abs); record a uses_abs flag on the Emitter; when rendering the final SMT script (render_satisfiability_with / lift_rule_to_implication_clause emit prelude), if uses_abs prepend (define-fun anthill_abs ((x Real)) Real (ite (< x 0) (- x) x)) and rewrite all (abs ...) call sites to (anthill_abs ...). Acceptance: lf1 step_distance_lemma h_geometric lifts with valid abs interpretation; cargo test green. Unblocks: WI-148, WI-149."), context: none, acceptance: [ToolPasses(tool: "cargo-test", params: none)], depends_on: some(value: nil), generates: none, requires_capability: none, status: Delivered(agent: "claude", at: "2026-04-29T06:51:10Z"))
